text:
Score: 4/10. I would not approve this as-is.

The code is readable and the small pure-Python pieces mostly behave, but the project fails its own tiny end-to-end test from a clean checkout because the required story dataset is missing. The HF path also has several unvalidated assumptions that would make production or research results fragile.

Verification: after installing declared dependencies, `pytest` ran with 6 passing tests and 1 failing integration test. Syntax compilation passed when bytecode was redirected to `/tmp`.

Estimated rewrite/significant-change scope: about 330 lines.

```json
{
  "score": 4,
  "issues": [
    {
      "file": "emovec/extract.py",
      "lines": "25-27",
      "severity": "high",
      "description": "Even --tiny extraction requires data/stories/manifest.json and story files that are not present, so the documented demo and integration test fail from a clean checkout."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/data.py",
      "lines": "24-45",
      "severity": "high",
      "description": "Story loading has no built-in generation or fallback path despite README claims, making the pipeline dependent on absent external data."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/extract.py",
      "lines": "25-27",
      "severity": "medium",
      "description": "The full run constructs/downloads the HuggingFace backend before validating that input data exists, wasting time and resources before predictable failure."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/validate_contexts.py",
      "lines": "21-28",
      "severity": "high",
      "description": "Vector artifacts are loaded without validating backend, layer count, d_model, emotion count, or shape compatibility with the configured backend."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/steer_prefs.py",
      "lines": "26-39",
      "severity": "medium",
      "description": "Preference steering also trusts vector artifact shape and manifest compatibility, so mismatched artifacts can crash or produce invalid measurements."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/model.py",
      "lines": "280-294",
      "severity": "medium",
      "description": "HF steering hook does not validate vector dimensionality or layer compatibility before mutating hidden states."
    },
    {
      "file": "emovec/model.py",
      "lines": "306-308",
      "severity": "medium",
      "description": "HF preference score uses only the first token of ' good' and ' bad', which is tokenizer-dependent and not a robust preference probability."
    },
    {
      "file": "pyproject.toml",
      "lines": "10-20",
